<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 308-day t-bill auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 308-day t-bill auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday 308-day T-bills with Wednesday settlement, after it sold 290.2 trillion lira nominal-valued nine-month bills on July 1.</p>
<p>The treasury faces 104 trillion lira of coupon repayments and bond redemptions on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : May 13,1998.</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>    Auction date: July 8, 1997</p>
<p>    Value date  : July 9, 1997</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
</text>
